#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Telepathy Glib"
msgstr "Instalação do \"Telepathy Glib\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix building this package with gcc-14:"
msgstr "Primeiro, corrija a construção desse pacote com gcc-14:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '1794 s/tp_value_array_free/(GDestroyNotify)"
" tp_value_array_free/' telepathy-glib/protocol.c</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '1794 s/tp_value_array_free/(GDestroyNotify)"
" tp_value_array_free/' telepathy-glib/protocol.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you intend to run the tests, one of them defaults to invoking "
"<filename>/usr/bin/python</filename> and fails if it is absent, causing the "
"second batch of tests to not run - unlike the other tests which can be "
"overridden from the environment. Fix it with the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você pretende executar os testes, [então] um deles, por padrão, invoca "
"<filename>/usr/bin/python</filename> e falha se ele estiver ausente, "
"causando o segundo lote de testes não ser executado - ao contrário dos "
"outros testes que podem ser substituídos a partir do ambiente. Corrija-o com"
" o seguinte comando:"

#.  Still needed with 0.24.2
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's%/usr/bin/python%&amp;3%' tests/all-errors-"
"documented.py</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's%/usr/bin/python%&amp;3%' tests/all-errors-"
"documented.py</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Telepathy GLib</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Telepathy GLib</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>PYTHON=/usr/bin/python3 ./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"                                    --enable-vala-bindings \\\n"
"                                    --disable-static       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>PYTHON=/usr/bin/python3 ./configure --prefix=/usr   \\\n"
"                                    --enable-vala-bindings \\\n"
"                                    --disable-static       &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. Four tests are known to fail: <emphasis>
#. test-account</emphasis>,
#.       <emphasis>test-cm</emphasis>, <emphasis>test-contact-
#. lists</emphasis>, and
#.       <emphasis>test-contact-list-client</emphasis>.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:157
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/telepathy-glib.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-vala-bindings</parameter>: This switch enables building "
"of the Vala bindings. Remove if you don't have <xref linkend=\"vala\"/> "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-vala-bindings</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"construção das ligações \"Vala\". Remova-a se você não tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"vala\"/> instalado."

